{
  "_instructions": [
    "Benchmark: intent classification in the confirmation phase.",
    "The frame is complete. The system has produced the summary and asks 'Is this correct?'.",
    "The user responds and the system must classify into: confirms | corrects | question | unclear",
    "",
    "Required fields:",
    "  id                  : unique identifier (e.g. ic_001)",
    "  description         : what is being tested",
    "  task                : task description",
    "  slot_schema         : slot schema (used to build the frame)",
    "  frame_filled        : complete frame state (all slots filled)",
    "  user_text           : what the user says in response to the summary",
    "  expected_intent     : 'confirms' | 'corrects' | 'question' | 'unclear'",
    "  expected_corrections: dict slot->value when intent=corrects (empty if not applicable)",
    "  notes               : observations",
    "",
    "Most costly errors (prioritize in the dataset):",
    "  - 'confirms' classified as 'unclear' -> the confirmation is lost",
    "  - 'corrects' classified as 'confirms' -> wrong information gets confirmed"
  ],
